<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S2.p5.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.p5.3.1" class="ltx_text">with the same integrand. The first term above is the one that we are estimating, and we proceed to estimate the second term. We note that for the integrand, we can rewrite as follows</span></p>
