ow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int_{B_{9r/10}}\int_{B_{9r/10}}\frac{(u(x)-u(y))^{2}}{|x-y|^{n+2s}}\leq\sup_{B_{r}}u\|f\|_{L^{1}(B_{r})}+Cr^{n}\sup_{B_{r}}|u|.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
