<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.E33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq C\int_{|x-y|&lt;1}\int_{B_{9r/10}}\frac{|x-y|^{2}}{|x-y|^{n+2s}}+\int_{|x-y|&gt;1}\int_{B_{9r/10}}\frac{1}{|x-y|^{n+2s}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub></msub></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub></msub></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq C\int_{|x-y|&lt;1}\int_{B_{9r/10}}\frac{|x-y|^{2}}{|x-y|^{n+2s}}+\int_{|x-y|&gt;1}\int_{B_{9r/10}}\frac{1}{|x-y|^{n+2s}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq C." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq C.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.p8.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.p8.11.1" class="ltx_text">Combining all the estimates above, we have</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Lambda|\{u&gt;0\}\cap B_{3r/4}|\leq Cr^{n}\sup_{B_{r}}u" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0.167em">≤</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><munder><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">sup</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></munder><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Lambda|\{u&gt;0\}\cap B_{3r/4}|\leq Cr^{n}\sup_{B_{r}}u</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">We prove the following equivalent statement of the Theorem: for any <math id="S3.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> small, there exists <math id="S3.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{0}&gt;r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{0}&gt;r</annotation></semantics></math>, such that (<a href="#S3.E21" title="In Lemma 3.20. ‣ 3. Boundedness of Shape Minimizers ‣ Minimizing Eigenvalues of the Fractional Laplacian" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.21</span></a>) is true. Suppose for contradiction that there exists <math id="S3.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, there exists <math id="S3.p9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon&lt;\epsilon_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon&lt;\epsilon_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, such that for all <math id="S3.p9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R&gt;r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R&gt;r</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sup_{B_{R}}u\leq\epsilon R^{s}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">sup</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></munder><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sup_{B_{R}}u\leq\epsilon R^{s}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">We claim that</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sup_{B_{r/2}(0)}u&lt;\frac{\epsilon}{2}\left(\frac{r}{2}\right)^{s}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">sup</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>s</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sup_{B_{r/2}(0)}u&lt;\frac{\epsilon}{2}\left(\frac{r}{2}\right)^{s}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.p9.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.p9.3.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="S3.p9.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y\in B_{r/2}(0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y\in B_{r/2}(0)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S3.p9.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{0}\in B_{r/4}(y)\subset B_{r}(0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{0}\in B_{r/4}(y)\subset B_{r}(0)</annotation></semantics></math>, by Theorem 1.2<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib24" title="" class="ltx_ref">24</a>]</cite>, we have:</span></p>
<table id="S3.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S3.E34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_left">(3.34)</span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.E34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle|u(x_{0})|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle|u(x_{0})|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.E34.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\int_{0}^{r/4}\left(\frac{|B_{t}(x_{0})|}{t^{n-2s}}\frac{1}{t}\right)dt+C\left(\frac{1}{|B_{r/4}(x_{0})|}\int_{B_{r/4}(x_{0})}|u(x)|dx\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\int_{0}^{r/4}\left(\frac{|B_{t}(x_{0})|}{t^{n-2s}}\frac{1}{t}\right)dt+C\left(\frac{1}{|B_{r/4}(x_{0})|}\int_{B_{r/4}(x_{0})}|u(x)|dx\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.E35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_left">(3.35)</span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.E35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+C\left(\left(\frac{r}{4}\right)^{2s}\int_{\mathcal{R}^{n}_{k}\setminus B_{r/4}(x_{0})}\frac{|u(x)|}{|x-x_{0}|^{n+2s}}dx\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>∖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+C\left(\left(\frac{r}{4}\right)^{2s}\int_{\mathcal{R}^{n}_{k}\setminus B_{r/4}(x_{0})}\frac{|u(x)|}{|x-x_{0}|^{n+2s}}dx\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.p9.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.p9.4.1" class="ltx_text">We estimate the three terms above respectively:</span></p>
<table id="S3.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S3.E36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_left">(3.36)</span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.E36.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle 1.)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 1.)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.E36.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\int_{0}^{r/4}\left(\frac{|B_{t}(x_{0})|}{t^{n-2s}}\frac{1}{t}\right)dt=C\left(\frac{r}{4}\right)^{2s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\int_{0}^{r/4}\left(\frac{|B_{t}(x_{0})|}{t^{n-2s}}\frac{1}{t}\right)dt=C\left(\frac{r}{4}\right)^{2s}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
