<div id="S5.Thmthm2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_rem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S5.Thmthm2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Remark 5.2</span></span><span id="S5.Thmthm2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></h6>
<div id="S5.Thmthm2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.Thmthm2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We note that including the set of interior nodal points</p>
<table id="S5.E3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_left">(5.3)</span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.E3.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{x:\exists r&gt;0,|B_{r}(x)\cap A^{c}|=0,u_{k}(x)=0\}\subset A" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∃</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0.167em">=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>⊂</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{x:\exists r&gt;0,|B_{r}(x)\cap A^{c}|=0,u_{k}(x)=0\}\subset A</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.Thmthm2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">doesn’t change the <math id="S5.Thmthm2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-th eigenvalue and corresponding eigenfunctions. Therefore, we take <math id="S5.Thmthm2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A=A\cup\{B_{r}(x):|B_{r}(x)\cap A^{c}|=0\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.278em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A=A\cup\{B_{r}(x):|B_{r}(x)\cap A^{c}|=0\}</annotation></semantics></math>. The points in (<a href="#S5.E3" title="In Remark 5.2. ‣ 5. Optimal Regularity ‣ Minimizing Eigenvalues of the Fractional Laplacian" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.3</span></a>) are in the interior of <math id="S5.Thmthm2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> and it is known that the eigenfunctions are smooth in the interior, which is shown, for example, in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">19</a>]</cite>,.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S5.Thmthm4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_prop">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S5.Thmthm4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition 5.4</span></span><span id="S5.Thmthm4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S5.Thmthm4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.Thmthm4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.Thmthm4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="S5.Thmthm4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> be a <math id="S5.Thmthm4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{k}</annotation></semantics></math>-minimizer of problem (<a href="#S1.E1" title="In 1. Introduction ‣ Minimizing Eigenvalues of the Fractional Laplacian" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1.1</span></a>), and <math id="S5.Thmthm4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{u_{k-i}\}_{i=0}^{l-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{u_{k-i}\}_{i=0}^{l-1}</annotation></semantics></math> be the corresponding eigenfunctions of the minimizing <math id="S5.Thmthm4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{k}</annotation></semantics></math>, then there exist <math id="S5.Thmthm4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{k-l+1},\cdots,\alpha_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{k-l+1},\cdots,\alpha_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> such that for</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{\alpha}=\alpha_{k-l+1}u_{k-l+1}+\cdots+\alpha_{k}u_{k},\ \|u_{\alpha}\|_{L^{2}}=1," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{\alpha}=\alpha_{k-l+1}u_{k-l+1}+\cdots+\alpha_{k}u_{k},\ \|u_{\alpha}\|_{L^{2}}=1,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.Thmthm4.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.Thmthm4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">we have</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B[u_{\alpha}-h,u_{\alpha}-h]\leq Cr^{n}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B[u_{\alpha}-h,u_{\alpha}-h]\leq Cr^{n}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S5.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">By the minimality of <math id="S5.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="S5.E5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_left">(5.5)</span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.E5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{k}(A)+|A|\leq\lambda_{k}(A\cup B_{r})+|A\cup B_{r}|\Rightarrow\lambda_{k}(A)\leq\lambda_{k}(A\cup B_{r})+Cr^{n}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{k}(A)+|A|\leq\lambda_{k}(A\cup B_{r})+|A\cup B_{r}|\Rightarrow\lambda_{k}(A)\leq\lambda_{k}(A\cup B_{r})+Cr^{n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Let <math id="S5.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w=h-u_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w=h-u_{k}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S5.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{w}=w-\sum_{i=1}^{k-1}\textit{Proj}_{\mathbf{u_{i}}}{w}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo rspace="0.055em">−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Proj</mtext><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mi>𝐢</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{w}=w-\sum_{i=1}^{k-1}\textit{Proj}_{\mathbf{u_{i}}}{w}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S5.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{w}_{j}=\textit{Proj}_{\mathbf{u_{j}}}{\tilde{w}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Proj</mtext><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mi>𝐣</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{w}_{j}=\textit{Proj}_{\mathbf{u_{j}}}{\tilde{w}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S5.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=u-l+1,\cdots,k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=u-l+1,\cdots,k</annotation></semantics></math>. Here</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{Proj}_{\mathbf{u_{i}}}{w}=B[w,u_{i}]u_{i}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Proj</mtext><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mi>𝐢</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{Proj}_{\mathbf{u_{i}}}{w}=B[w,u_{i}]u_{i}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">is the projection of <math id="S5.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>w</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w</annotation></semantics></math> in the direction <math id="S5.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>. Let</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{\alpha}=\sum_{j=k-l+1}^{k}\alpha_{j}\tilde{w}_{j}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{\alpha}=\sum_{j=k-l+1}^{k}\alpha_{j}\tilde{w}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">for <math id="S5.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>’s to be chosen.
Then by the min-max property of <math id="S5.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{k}(A\cup B_{r})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{k}(A\cup B_{r})</annotation></semantics></math>, for any <math id="S5.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in{\mathbb{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in{\mathbb{R}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="S5.EGx33" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S5.E6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_left">(5.6)</span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S5.E6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\lambda_{k}(A\cup B_{r})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\lambda_{k}(A\cup B_{r})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S5.E6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\max_{\alpha_{1},...\alpha_{k}}R[\sum_{i=1}^{k-l}\alpha_{i}u_{i}+\sum_{i=k-l+1}^{k}\alpha_{j}(u_{j}+t\tilde{w}_{j})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\max_{\alpha_{1},...\alpha_{k}}R[\sum_{i=1}^{k-l}\alpha_{i}u_{i}+\sum_{i=k-l+1}^{k}\alpha_{j}(u_{j}+t\tilde{w}_{j})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S5.E7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_left">(5.7)</span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S5.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=R[\sum_{j=k-l+1}^{k}(\alpha_{j}u_{j}+t\alpha_{j}\tilde{w}_{j})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=R[\sum_{j=k-l+1}^{k}(\alpha_{j}u_{j}+t\alpha_{j}\tilde{w}_{j})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S5.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
