\|u_{\alpha}+tw_{\alpha}\|^{2}_{L^{2}}=\|u_{\alpha}\|^{2}_{L^{2}}+t^{2}\|w_{\alpha}\|^{2}_{L^{2}}+2t(u_{\alpha},w_{\alpha})_{L^{2}}=1+t^{2}\|w_{\alpha}\|^{2}_{L^{2}}+2t(u_{\alpha},w_{\alpha})_{L^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
