<p id="S6.p5.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p5.4.1" class="ltx_text">where we used (<a href="#S6.E3" title="In Proof. ‣ 6. Non-degeneracy ‣ Minimizing Eigenvalues of the Fractional Laplacian" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.3</span></a>) for the terms involving <math id="S6.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(u(x)-u(y))^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(u(x)-u(y))^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, and we used <math id="S6.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\varphi(x)-\varphi(y)|&lt;C|x-y|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\varphi(x)-\varphi(y)|&lt;C|x-y|</annotation></semantics></math> when <math id="S6.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|x-y|&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|x-y|&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="S6.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varphi\leq 1" display="inline" intent=":lite