<p id="S6.p8.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p8.2.1" class="ltx_text">By (<a href="#S6.E4" title="In Proof. ‣ 6. Non-degeneracy ‣ Minimizing Eigenvalues of the Fractional Laplacian" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.4</span></a>), the first two terms above satisfies the desired inequality, and it is left to estimate the third term. Let <math id="S6.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi=1-\varphi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi=1-\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math id="S6.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u-v=\psi u" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u-v=\psi u</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
