<p id="S6.p11.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p11.6.1" class="ltx_text">Combining (<a href="#S6.E38" title="In Proof. ‣ 6. Non-degeneracy ‣ Minimizing Eigenvalues of the Fractional Laplacian" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.38</span></a>) and (<a href="#S6.E39" title="In Proof. ‣ 6. Non-degeneracy ‣ Minimizing Eigenvalues of the Fractional Laplacian" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.39</span></a>), we have that for any <math id="S6.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1,\cdots,k-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1,\cdots,k-1</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
