</table>
<p id="S6.p11.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p11.7.1" class="ltx_text">We note that the proof of (<a href="#S6.E21" title="In Proof. ‣ 6. Non-degeneracy ‣ Minimizing Eigenvalues of the Fractional Laplacian" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.21</span></a>) also show that</span></p>
