</table>
<p id="S7.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">We observe that since <math id="S7.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> is solution to our minimization problem, and thus the critical point of the functional</span></p>
<table id="S7.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

