<p id="S9.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S9.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">Here the last inequality follows from that <math id="S9.p3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u,v\in C^{0,s}(K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u,v\in C^{0,s}(K)</annotation></semantics></math>, for <math id="S9.p3.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K\subset\subset B_{r}(x_{0},0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K\subset\subset B_{r}(x_{0},0)</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
