<p id="S9.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S9.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">The right hand side of (<a href="#S9.E5" title="In Proof. ‣ 9. Free Boundary Regularity ‣ Minimizing Eigenvalues of the Fractional Laplacian" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9.5</span></a>) is thus bounded by</span></p>
